  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 804.14 Exemptions. The use of closed systems, as defined under Pes 804.01(b), greater than 55 gallons but less than 300 gallons in capacity shall be exempt from Pes 804.02.\n\nSource. #5611, eff 4-13-93; amd by #5734, eff 11-5-93 (From Pes 803.13); ss and moved by #5766, eff 12-28-93 (From Pes 804.13); ss by #6317, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
